     "source": "model knowledge",
     "kind": "capability"
    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: from supplies needed to the delivery checked; paying invoices is outside.",
    "Input contract: contract catalogue kept by purchasing; fallback is supplier websites and e-mail.",
    "Scenario: about 70% of order lines are in the contract catalogue.",
    "The advisor checks every order."
   ],
