   "design": "Incident reports and warnings are kept on the student's file in the residence management system ({OPS_SYSTEM}), so the advisor does not gather them from folders and e-mails. The cancellation letter template fills the student, contract, end date and the listed incidents, and the advisor writes the reasons. Once checked, the letter goes to the student from the system. Entering the cancellation there ends the contract, frees the room and notifies the housing office, so no separate e-mail is needed. Deciding and meeting the student stay with the advisor.",
